<title>USA: Guilford licenses chemotherapy patent.</title>
<headline>Guilford licenses chemotherapy patent.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guilford Pharmaceuticals Inc said Thursday that it has licensed the rights to a patent titled &quot;Controlled Local Delivery of Chemotherapeutic Agents for Treating Solid Tumors.&quot;</p>
<p>Guilford said it has exclusively licensed rights to this patent, which related to the delivery of cancer chemotherapeutic agents in biodegradable polymers, from the Massachusetts Institute of Technology and Johns Hopkins University.</p>
